I go to the supermarket in my neighbourhood.
This supermarket is very big.
There is a lot of light here.
I take a small shopping cart.
I push the cart forward.
There are long aisles of goods here.
First of all, I want rice.
I go near the rice shelf.
There are many types of rice here.
I like basmati rice a lot.
I pick up a big packet of rice.
This packet is very heavy.
I carefully put it in the cart.
Now I want yellow dal.
I go near the next shelf.
I select a packet of yellow dal.
I put this dal in the cart too.
I like this clean and big shop.
